Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 11:33:33 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 18/18] Revert "printenv,env: quote problematic variables"

This reverts commit 328322ca641a9eb2b500ab8f9e3cb68c41e1aa30.
NEWS left untouched.
---
